    "gid": "441434520",
    "rowKey": "Borealis\n\nThe Fundamentals \nIonic Return\n↑Shield Disorient",
    "section": "Energy Slot Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Multi-Element Aggressive Sniper Rifle\n[Reload] switches between the Arc, Solar, and Void Elements.\nChosen element persists through stow and death. Defaults to Void Element.\n\nGrants 30% [10%] increased damage for 11 seconds upon inflicting or receiving an Elemental Effect that matches the currently selected Element.\n\nBreaking a Matching Shield refills the Magazine and grants 5 stacks of Ionic Return, up to a maximum of 5 stacks.\nGuardians in their Super Ability count as having an Elemental Shield that matches the element of their Super.\n\n Ionic Return:\nConsumes a stack upon firing.\n15% increased damage and 19% increased Precision Damage (+0.666 to Precision Multiplier). \n37% total increased Precision damage over base.\nIonic Return shots persist through stow and reloads.\n\n↑Catalyst:\nPassively grants +20 Reload Speed and the Shield Disorient trait.",
